{"song_id": 665643, "title": "Le sonkifoud\u00e9cou", "language": "en", "lyricists": [55334], "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_1", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "J'ex\u00e8cre la rumba", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Mon truc, c\u2019est d\u2019la bomba", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "C\u2019est la d\u00e8r' des d\u00e8r' que j'ressors de ma tomba", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Encore un coup de crasse et j\u2019te rosse \u00e0 coup d\u2019crosse", "rhyme": "Os", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "V\u2019la l\u2019molosse, pas l\u2019bolosse", "rhyme": "Os", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Qui fait peur aux rhinoc\u00e9ros", "rhyme": "Os", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Trop la classe", "rhyme": "as", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "La rythmique tabasse dans l\u2019espace", "rhyme": "as", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Et les rapaces tr\u00e9passent sous les secousses de ma carcasse", "rhyme": "as", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "Trop d\u2019la balle, trop maboule", "rhyme": "ul", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "10", "text": "Farandole de nerfs en boule, cool", "rhyme": "ul", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "11", "text": "J\u2019agresse la foule et fais peur m\u00eame aux cannibales", "rhyme": "al", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AAABBBCCCDDE", "rhyme_vowel": "AAABBBAAACCA"}, {"section_id": "section_2", "type": "refrain", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "C\u2019est le sonkifoud\u00e9cou, Stupeflip CROU", "rhyme": "u", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Faut pas qu\u2019les narvals se graillent les fils de pute ou aie aie aie", "rhyme": "E", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "C\u2019est le sonkifoud\u00e9cou, Stupeflip CROU", "rhyme": "u", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Encore un coup de crasse et j\u2019te rosse \u0